  "description": "Bubblegum Groove is a bold, chunky bubble font inspired by nostalgic 70s groovy typography. Featuring thick, rounded letterforms with a playful bouncy baseline, this fun display font brings retro charm and personality to any design project. Perfect for t-shirt designs, sublimation projects, birthday invitations, kids’ branding, retro posters, logo design, and social media graphics, Bubblegum Groove is a versatile go-to typeface for designers, crafters, and small business owners who want to add a fun, eye-catching, retro-inspired look to their work. The font includes uppercase letters, numbers, and essential punctuation, ready to use for both digital and print projects. Bring some groovy vibes into your designs with Bubblegum Groove!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bubblegum Groove is a bold, chunky bubble font inspired by nostalgic 70s groovy typography. Featuring thick, rounded letterforms with a playful bouncy baseline, this fun display font brings retro charm and personality to any design project. Perfect for t-shirt designs, sublimation projects, birthday invitations, kids’ branding, retro posters, logo design, and social media graphics, Bubblegum Groove is a versatile go-to typeface for designers, crafters, and small business owners who want to add a fun, eye-catching, retro-inspired look to their work. The font includes uppercase letters, numbers, and essential punctuation, ready to use for both digital and print projects. Bring some groovy vibes into your designs with Bubblegum Groove!</p>",
